{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356008-how-do-you-depict-high-essence-exalts","id":1356008,"title":"How do you depict high essence Exalts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-19T23:11:19-08:00","id":1356008,"title":"How do you depict high essence Exalts?","content":"Do you show them as demigods, whose step shakes the earth and whose breathe can topple fortressses? More akin to forces of nature than man? <br /> <br /> Ordinary looking people, until you realise that there's far more to them than meets the eye? <br /> <br /> People whose very presence is mind-bending, until meeting them face to face makes you fall to the ground?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-19T23:13:29-08:00","id":1356009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356008-how-do-you-depict-high-essence-exalts#post1356008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you show them as demigods, whose step shakes the earth and whose breathe can topple fortressses? More akin to forces of nature than man? <br /> <br /> Ordinary looking people, until you realise that there's far more to them than meets the eye? <br /> <br /> People whose very presence is mind-bending, until meeting them face to face makes you fall to the ground?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the Exalt.<br /> <br /> A master Lunar infiltrator will be more like your middle example. A charismatic Solar with Sun King Radiance, more like the last.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 12-20-2019, 02:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-19T23:26:25-08:00","id":1356010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356008-how-do-you-depict-high-essence-exalts?p=1356009#post1356009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Depends on the Exalt.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly this. <br /> It's important to remember that any Exalt without charms active is a totally normal person until they spend Essence. <br /> So how does a normal, if important and skilled, person appear? Depends on the person! <br /> And if they're spending Essence, it's going to depend on what charms they're using and how their Essence expresses itself. <br /> <br /> So without knowing who these &quot;high essence Exalts&quot; <i>are</i>, all I can really say is \u00af\\_(\u30c4)_/\u00af. Which I know isn't the answer you want, but unfortunately it's the correct one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25764-vwllss-trnt-prncss","name":"vwllss trnt prncss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"244"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T04:46:42-08:00","id":1356042,"title":"","content":"As long as they're not making an effort to keep a low profile, I'd go with the Granny Weatherwax &quot;fade into the foreground&quot; bit-- without doing anything in particular, they're just a little more present, more attention-grabbing, more <i>real </i>than anyone else around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T06:28:38-08:00","id":1356075,"title":"","content":"In my longest running high Essence game, my character The Prince of Iron and Fire was like World Breaker Hulk. By the end of that campaign Creation itself groaned under the weight of his majesty upon it.<br /> <br /> Sweet, our Dawn, was more like Bruce Banner from Old Man Logan. He seemed perfectly normal in every way. Until he drop kicked you off the planet. The first time the Ebon Dragon escaped, Sweet said &quot;nope&quot; and just <i>threw</i> him back into hell on the first round of combat (whilst the rest of us were still powering up, activating our Scene-longs, going into our Final Forms, and pulling artifacts out of Elsewhere).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T06:30:24-08:00","id":1356077,"title":"","content":"There are a few effects that permanently change an exalt, like sorcerous initiations and terrestrial aspect markings, but not too many. There\u2019s other things that might be imposing about them though, like artifacts. Sitting in an oversized suit of golden armor with a rose scented green jade daiklave beside you is pretty formidable.<br /> <br /> Besides that they could activate some charms that last for a short while. Those effects are usually less big and flashy for Solars, but they\u2019re scary, like Graceful Crane stance, which has the Solar lightly stepping around maintaining absolutely perfect graceful balance wherever they choose to go, or Ready in Eight Directions Stance, where they seem to respond with lightning speed to any assault. You also have DB charms like the one where you activate it and your body explodes into a tangled mess of brambles and thorns, or ignite the air around you into a majestic bonfire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T07:48:32-08:00","id":1356093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356008-how-do-you-depict-high-essence-exalts#post1356008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you show them as demigods, whose step shakes the earth and whose breathe can topple fortressses? More akin to forces of nature than man? <br /> <br /> People whose very presence is mind-bending, until meeting them face to face makes you fall to the ground?</div> </div> </div> </div>There actually ARE things in the setting that are like that though. When the Primordials walked Creation they moved mountains, not because they had a charm which they poured motes into to become strong enough to lift an entire fucking landscape, it\u2019s just they were that large and that strong. Then there\u2019s stuff like the Brass Dancer, jotun avatar of Malfeas. The Brass Dancer is the kind of thing that in his presence you drop to your knees and swear loyalty to the embodiment of rulership. Actually you probably dance with him because that\u2019s what he likes making people do. Again that\u2019s not a charm though, there\u2019s no effort being put forth there, he simply IS that, and ten thousand other things at once as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T08:35:49-08:00","id":1356104,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356008-how-do-you-depict-high-essence-exalts#post1356008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you show them as demigods, whose step shakes the earth and whose breathe can topple fortressses? More akin to forces of nature than man? <br /> <br /> Ordinary looking people, until you realise that there's far more to them than meets the eye? <br /> <br /> People whose very presence is mind-bending, until meeting them face to face makes you fall to the ground?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ma-Ha-Suchi is somebody who the locals might play pranks on as part of their annual ritual competition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}